我知道你们是怎么想的.
Hey, look. I know what you guys are thinking...

67
00:04:58,480 --> 00:05:01,960
不过我还是要这首诗作为敲门砖 然后我就自力更生
but I'm just gonna use this poem to get her to talk to me. Then I'll be myself.

68
00:05:02,700 --> 00:05:06,480
好吧，如果你们认为.
Well, if you guys think that a $3 poem is any substitute...

69
