坦诚只值3块钱的话，那随便
for real and honest communication, then go ahead.

70
00:05:11,377 --> 00:05:13,233
麦克，爸爸说得对
Mike, Dad's right.

71
00:05:13,580 --> 00:05:15,020
坦诚至少值5块钱
Real and honest is gonna cost you $5.

72
00:05:19,320 --> 00:05:22,420
“目光扫视前方”
"With eyes that scan the distance

73
00:05:23,000 --> 00:05:25,440
“双脚在沙滩上”
"With feet that cross the sand

74
00:05:26,340 --> 00:05:28,280
“浮想联翩..”
"With thoughts that keep me dreaming

75
00:05:28,760 --> 00:05:30,840
“呆呆矗立..”
"This place is where I stand

76
00:05:31,320 --> 00:05:33,160
“我恨母亲”
"I hate my mother."

77
