83
00:05:59,380 --> 00:06:01,520
老师，人说.
Miss Jeffress, you know how they always say...

84
00:06:01,520 --> 00:06:03,720
教师是最辛苦的园丁.
that despite all the hardships of teaching...

85
00:06:03,720 --> 00:06:06,400
栽培的是国家的栋梁
there are those rare moments that make it all worthwhile?

86
00:06:06,833 --> 00:06:08,052
嗯
Yes.

87
00:06:08,768 --> 00:06:10,590
这是送给你的
This ones for you.

88
00:06:20,660 --> 00:06:23,220
“你我二人走吧”
"Let us go then, you and l

89
00:06:23,980 --> 00:06:27,460
“夜色晶莹，像一只拍扁的苍蝇”
"When the evening is spread out like a swatted fly

90
00:06:28,921 --> 00:06:32,474
“生命中充满瘴气，充斥着原胶质”
"Life being miasmic, somewhat protoplasmic

91
00:06:32,960 --> 00:06:35,520
“雨淋漓..”
"What does it matter if raindrops pitter-patter

