97
00:07:12,965 --> 00:07:16,002
在现代文化的底蕴中.
I found it to be a fascinating parodic melding...

98
00:07:16,002 --> 00:07:18,220
渗透着一种诙谐的韵味.
of popular culture and the lyrical mode.

99
00:07:18,220 --> 00:07:19,900
是啊？正是!
Yeah, yeah, that's it!

100
