121
00:08:30,960 --> 00:08:32,020
是神童
Prodigy, Ben.

122
00:08:33,140 --> 00:08:36,260
对，我告诉朱丽叶.
Yeah, Ben, see, I just told Juliet that you we're sort of a....

123
00:08:37,120 --> 00:08:39,280
你是某种哲学奇才
Well, that you we're a genius at philosophy.

124
00:08:39,880 --> 00:08:42,060
当我这样打眼色时.
So whenever I wink at you like this...

125
00:08:42,060 --> 00:08:44,460
你就念一句这些话
I want you to read one of these little phrases here.

126
00:08:44,460 --> 00:08:45,300
好的，试试看
All right, et's try one.

127
00:08:47,120 --> 00:08:50,700
-我思故我在 -很好
- "I think, therefore I am." - Good, good.

128
