154
00:10:15,180 --> 00:10:16,600
有时也会用瓷漆
and some high-gloss enamel.

155
00:10:17,280 --> 00:10:18,820
要看看我最新的作品吗？
Would you like to see one of my recent works?

156
00:10:19,080 --> 00:10:21,200
我称之为“楼上的厕所”
I call it, "Upstairs Bathroom."

157
00:10:21,760 --> 00:10:23,280
爸爸，今天可没时间欣赏了
Dad, no! Maybe some other time.

158
00:10:24,080 --> 00:10:26,560
西弗先生，你是否受了.
Mr. Seaver, tell me, have you been influenced...

159
00:10:26,560 --> 00:10:29,580
最近德国的抽象表现主义的影响？
by the recent wave of German abstract expressionists?

160
